   156	def spend(name, run=_run, clock=time.time, here=HERE, mono=time.monotonic):
   157	    """(USD rounded up to a cent, note) or (None, reason); on success also writes NAME.spent. Needs NAME.bal0, NAME.wdend
   158	    at least WAIT_AFTER_WATCHDOG s old by both wall and monotonic time (r17; after a restart the wait cannot be verified
   159	    and spend is refused), a successful listing with no pod named NAME, a readable balance, and a balance that did not
   160	    rise (a rise proves a credit or deposit). The difference is valid only if no deposit or credit was added in the
   161	    window (r16): the author confirms that on the Runpod billing page; the note names the window. It holds
   162	    NAME.launchlock while it works, so it cannot overlap a launch (r17), and publishes NAME.spent atomically."""
